This is a really cool feature of the package. I played around with the code a bit so that the sliders for the different parameter values use the "traditional" IRT parameterization, to help the students in the lab I'm TAing get a feel for how the traditional parameterization values can affect the trace lines. I'm trying to extent the graph a bit on the x-axis though -- I'd like to have something around xlim(-5,5) but I tried that and it only widened the graph without actually showing more of the trace lines. Can you tell me where I should be looking to modify this feature? Thanks in advance! (P.S. I'm not distributing anything I do -- I'm not at all trying to steal credit or anything like that, it's just for educational purposes.)

